Package: ootac
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: FILE INVERTER
 Reverses files line by line using fast backwards seek and ring buffer scanning.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
